Package: partisanShares
Type: Project
Title: Measuring Perceptions of the Share of Groups
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Douglas J.", "Ahler", role = "aut"),
    person("Gaurav", "Sood", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "gsood07@gmail.com")
  )
Description: Data, analyses and corrected manuscript for a 2018 book chapter on
    measuring perceptions of how large groups are, using MTurk survey experiments
    from 2014 and 2016 on time limits, question wording, sum-to-100 constraints,
    accuracy incentives and base rates.
